      "text": "batchIndex, l1MessagePopped, totalL1MessagePopped and lastBlockNumber are < 2^64; Solidity stores shl(192, x) of a uint256, so larger values would be truncated. Modelled as 8-byte fields (SORT width obligation, later milestone)."
